data: {"id": "7411ecc1a8294db4-final", "run_id": "7411ecc1a8294db4", "seq": 612, "ts_ms": 1789389030209, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe 配置错误（端口 18081）与应用实际监听端口（18080）不一致，导致 kubelet 探测失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning Unhealthy 3m22s (x513 over 43m) kubelet Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` [fact-bb91bc650177] | 直接症状：探针探测失败并产生大量连接拒绝错误 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Readiness Probe target: `http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready` | 配置证据：实际配置指向 18081 端口，引发后续探测失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Container resource limit (CPU: 200m, Memory: 64Mi); Pod phase: Running; Restarts: 0 [fact-d4ccf43d01bc][fact-1bfb01efe4e8][fact-853bbd365374] | 排除资源超发或容器重启导致的问题 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{container=\"app\", phase=\"Running\"} = 1` [fact-e8922db62bbe] | 状态印证：应用容器实际处于运行状态，具备服务监听能力 |\n\n证据相互印证：Metric [4] 确认容器进程活跃（Running），排除了应用崩溃或容器不可用的情况；结合 K8s Config [2] 的 18081 端口配置与 Event [1] 中明确的 `connect: connection refused` 错误，证实是配置端口与监听端口不匹配导致的网络探测失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n探针配置监听 18081 端口，但应用代码监听 18080 端口 → Kubelet 向 18081 发起 TCP 连接 → 目标端口无进程监听，直接拒绝连接 (Connection Refused) → 探针连续失败，Ready 状态变为 False\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **Readiness Probe 配置错误**。K8s 探测配置（目标端口 18081）与应用程序实际监听端口（18080）不一致。\n\n该错误直接导致了 `kubelet` 在探测时遭遇 `connection refused` [fact-bb91bc650177]。由于 Metric 显示容器状态为 `Running` 且无重启记录 [fact-e8922db62bbe][fact-853bbd365374]，排除了进程崩溃或资源耗尽的可能性，确定这是典型的配置与部署不一致导致的服务可用性（Readiness）异常。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v16/workload: 32.0s (Evidence 25.1s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v16/workload**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 68.232, "metrics": {"run_id": "7411ecc1a8294db4", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 68.23397755622864, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 68233.97755622864, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 54636.428117752075, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 20097.594261169434, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 13199.216842651367}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 26271.826028823853, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "